# OGMP MARS Notification Implementation Plan

## Goal
Implement a simulated "OGMP MARS (Methane Alert and Response System)" notification in the [notification-logic.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/notification-logic.js) file. This will provide users with a rigorous, real-time alert simulation consistent with high-standard methane reporting.

## Proposed Changes

### [public/notification-logic.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/notification-logic.js)

#### [MODIFY]
- **Logic**: Implement a "Real-time Detection Engine" that randomly selects from a list of active Sonatrach zones:
  - Hassi Messaoud (Field A, B)
  - Hassi R'Mel (North/South)
  - In Amenas
  - Rhourde Nouss
  - Tin Fouyé Tabankort (TFT)
- **Content**: Dynamic message based on selection, e.g., "OGMP MARS Alert: Methane Plume Detected. Zone: [Random Zone]. Est. Rate: [Random Rate] kg/hr."
- **Frequency**: Generate 1-2 unique alerts to prompt user attention to multiple potentially affected areas.

